<https://w3id.org/mda/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Koppelt een fysiologische eigenschap aan het proces dat het karakteriseert."@nl .
<https://w3id.org/mda/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a physiological property to the process it characterises."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is eigenschap van"@nl .
<https://w3id.org/mda/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is property of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/isPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/mda/situational> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
