# https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/mda/Alarm> .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "hasEnd" .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Het eindtijdstip van het alarm."@nl .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The end time of the alarm."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/hasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has end"@en .
