<https://w3id.org/mda/Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Metric"@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Metriek"@nl .
<https://w3id.org/mda/Metric> <https://w3id.org/mda/nodeKind> <https://w3id.org/mda/Stateful> .
