<https://w3id.org/mda/Organ> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A biological organ."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/Organ> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Een biologisch orgaan."@nl .
