<https://w3id.org/mda/PhysiologicalProperty> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "PhysiologicalProperty" .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PhysiologicalProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A measurable property of a physiological process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PhysiologicalProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Een meetbare eigenschap van een fysiologisch proces."@nl .
