# https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "PostAlarmValidScheme" .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A SKOS concept scheme whose concepts remain valid for a fixed duration after an alarm ends."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Een SKOS-conceptschema waarvan de concepten geldig blijven gedurende een vaste duur nadat een alarm is geëindigd."@nl .
<https://w3id.org/mda/PostAlarmValidScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Post-alarm geldig schema"@nl .
