# 
<https://w3id.org/mda/vocab/organ-system/Scheme> <https://w3id.org/mda/instantiatesClass> <https://w3id.org/mda/OrganSystem> .
# 
<https://w3id.org/mda/vocab/organ/Scheme> <https://w3id.org/mda/instantiatesClass> <https://w3id.org/mda/Organ> .
# 
